   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_419de5394ac3e6b709ab",
   "sourceHash": "419de5394ac3e6b709ab0c4c3fc4ab6679d4969579710b1dd8437d4f9e594e4b",
   "text": "喀拉拉邦免疫力与高管健康疗法 – Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4995400da14686dc0c51",
   "sourceHash": "4995400da14686dc0c51ddd321aacd5812c67061418af313dbd17f459f47189b",
   "text": "在 Kairali，一位患者躺在木制治疗床上，接受温热草药粉阿育吠陀疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'Guest' rendered as 患者 (patient) per KTAHV language lock"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6d5b2c5777ff1a43a473",
   "sourceHash": "6d5b2c5777ff1a43a4736e4673d9ebd2aa2344f8c2bb98f90ac5cb9b1b5f5369",
   "text": "Kairali 治疗师在疗程中将温热的草药包按压在躺卧患者的颈部",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_24da818222e6c0d52d73",
   "sourceHash": "24da818222e6c0d52d73f0d0824a1d4ad1b2a14d921ff49721e68d8e63ee5a59",
   "text": "Kairali 治疗师在疗程中将温热的草药包敷于躺卧患者的面部",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d8d5d0fdb140c05b53cb",
   "sourceHash": "d8d5d0fdb140c05b53cb8d0eebf75374ac4dd95e2bf647f6dabaaea776d04602",
   "text": "根据健康评估结果，并结合体质类型和多沙（dosha）平衡情况，调理疗法将包括 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Podikizhi（波迪基兹）、Navarakizhi（纳瓦拉基兹）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）、Ksheeradhara（奇拉达拉）和 Nasyam（纳斯亚姆）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0106c20133caa469997b",
   "sourceHash": "0106c20133caa469997ba908796da4e2b0b7c209084c4b3692cf0e3989c9349d",
   "text": "企业高管和创业者",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6e34de23e7f02973bfd7",
   "sourceHash": "6e34de23e7f02973bfd7237a7e203418763e1bcf48e130c9d42ef4e8dbebada0",
   "text": "经常出差的人士和商务专业人士",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4c11a34e9bd6d1c06761",
   "sourceHash": "4c11a34e9bd6d1c06761c6e2c5438495aa20fa0f227c5eec7d3498b8c3451ad9",
   "text": "免疫力低下或长期疲劳的人士",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fdde06db8931ce10a043",
   "sourceHash": "fdde06db8931ce10a04369310ecfda7964ed9446caab71a4b03d7d46aecc6f1b",
   "text": "正从疾病或病毒感染中康复的人士",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_80735bb22c56f18fb8ad",
   "sourceHash": "80735bb22c56f18fb8ad9e632bfaf8c0ebd75ee873ea28c6cbd4f33ab681a36d",
   "text": "承受高度压力或身心倦怠的人士",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b8d35b2cd1dbec66b3df",
   "sourceHash": "b8d35b2cd1dbec66b3df6097f423305ce65fb614db92f5045c00671caa8bb37b",
   "text": "注重健康、寻求预防保健的专业人士",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9be710d23c27ba31146a",
   "sourceHash": "9be710d23c27ba31146ab0688467c9a42119f34e9c29c2901e0cb5f6a2189852",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]首页[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]/[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]全部治疗方案[[CLOSE_3]][[OPEN_4]]/[[CLOSE_4]][[OPEN_5]]阿育吠陀治疗项目[[CLOSE_5]][[OPEN_6]]/[[CLOSE_6]][[OPEN_7]]关节康复与关节炎治疗[[CLOSE_7]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_82757b7d7b9476a16f6b",
   "sourceHash": "82757b7d7b9476a16f6bbdf60581a5899ceeeb6f7edf2581eeae958e8fc6d7a4",
   "text": "Sandhivatam Chikitsa（Kairali 关节炎治疗项目 {骨关节炎与类风湿关节炎}）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_611bdc6554badd44c5ce",
   "sourceHash": "611bdc6554badd44c5ce68097fccfbc3b67947d851f8ef0d709008a24e55cd0c",
   "text": "阿育吠陀关节炎治疗，结合草药疗法、瑜伽与饮食调理。有助于减轻关节疼痛与炎症、改善活动能力。提供 14/21/28 天方案。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_20bcfb3737aece0b00b4",
   "sourceHash": "20bcfb3737aece0b00b433ed9f72267b940c7dd220f72044d6073892ea587e60",
   "text": "关于[[OPEN_1]]关节康复与关节炎治疗[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8f04e9de8865053083eb",
   "sourceHash": "8f04e9de8865053083ebafe2dcf5c7fc08df0c83302799e076d8c0e58e5c3360",
   "text": "如果您出现关节疼痛、发热、疲劳和食欲不振，可能是关节炎（骨关节炎或类风湿关节炎），这类症状往往会因衰老和瓦塔（Vata）多沙失衡而加重。Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 提供量身定制的 14/21/28 天方案，包括 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Podikizhi（波迪基兹）等疗法以及饮食建议。这些方案注重身体净化、增强免疫系统，并使用草药油进行个性化治疗。瑜伽、冥想以及喀拉拉邦的环境有助于康复。对于类风湿关节炎，会采用身体净化计划，并配合 Elakizhi（埃拉基兹）、Pizhichil（皮兹奇尔）等疗法。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d8770768d4bbbb5161dc",
   "sourceHash": "d8770768d4bbbb5161dc91d3bc0c37468d1c2e3e059e1579e73e61b206925b45",
   "text": "治疗将根据医生问诊、体质类型和病史量身定制。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0f2eadfcb652a30133f9",
   "sourceHash": "0f2eadfcb652a30133f968006d6eedc00d7b3fd115e1c3208888cce6ee8fa9d5",
   "text": "我们的[[OPEN_1]]关节康复与关节炎治疗[[CLOSE_1]]方法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
